#: ../developer/translations.md:1
msgid "Translating the docs"
msgstr "翻译文档"

#: ../developer/translations.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for translators, and for anyone whose English edit changes a"
" paragraph that has a translation. The site is published in English and "
"Simplified Chinese; the Chinese pages are at `/zh_CN/` and the sidebar "
"switches between them."
msgstr "这一页写给译者，也写给改了英文段落、而这段已经有译文的人。本站同时发布英文版和简体中文版，中文页面在 `/zh_CN/` 下，侧边栏可以随时切换。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:8
msgid ""
"The pages are written in English and translated with Sphinx's gettext "
"workflow, so a translation is attached to each paragraph of source text "
"rather than to a whole file. Any string without a translation falls back "
"to English, so the site always builds complete."
msgstr ""
"页面先用英文写，再通过 Sphinx 的 gettext "
"流程翻译。译文按段落对应原文，而不是整份文件对应。哪一段还没有译文，就显示英文，所以站点总能完整构建出来。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:21
msgid "A catalog entry pairs the English source with its translation:"
msgstr "catalog 里的每一条，都是一段英文原文配上它的译文："

#: ../developer/translations.md:28
msgid ""
"The English text is the lookup key, so editing a paragraph invalidates "
"its translation automatically: the page falls back to English for that "
"paragraph instead of serving a translation that no longer matches what "
"the code does. That is the reason to use catalogs rather than parallel "
"`.zh-CN.md` files, which drift silently."
msgstr ""
"英文原文本身就是查找译文的键。只要改了一段英文，这段的旧译文就自动失效，页面上改为显示英文，不会继续摆着一段和代码对不上的译文。这也是我们用 "
"catalog、而不另写一份 `.zh-CN.md` 的原因：平行维护的文件过时了也没人察觉。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:34
msgid ""
"Commit the `.po` files. `docs/gettext/` and compiled `.mo` files are "
"generated and ignored."
msgstr "`.po` 文件要提交。`docs/gettext/` 和编译出来的 `.mo` 文件都是生成的，已经在忽略列表里。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:37
msgid "When you change an English page"
msgstr "改了英文页面之后"

#: ../developer/translations.md:39
msgid ""
"Run `make docs-translate` and translate the entries it adds or marks `#, "
"fuzzy`, then delete the `#, fuzzy` line and any obsolete `#~` entries. "
"`make docs-verify` fails until every English string has a current "
"translation. If you cannot translate a change yourself, say so in the "
"pull request; a reviewer who can will add it."
msgstr ""
"运行 `make docs-translate`，把新增的条目和标成 `#, fuzzy` 的条目翻译好，再删掉 `#, fuzzy` "
"这一行，以及所有作废的 `#~` 条目。只要还有一段英文没有对应的最新译文，`make docs-verify` "
"就不会通过。如果你自己翻不了，就在 pull request 里说一声，由能翻的评审者补上。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:45
msgid "Chinese style"
msgstr "中文文风"

#: ../developer/translations.md:47
msgid ""
"Write the Chinese an experienced colleague would write to explain the "
"page, not a sentence-by-sentence rendering of the English. Read the whole"
" section first, work out what it is telling the reader, and then say that"
" in Chinese. A reader should not be able to tell which language the page "
"was written in."
msgstr "要写成一位有经验的同事给你讲这一页时会说的中文，而不是把英文一句一句搬过来。先把整节读完，弄清楚它想告诉读者什么，再用中文把这件事说出来。理想的效果是，读者看不出这一页原本是用哪种语言写的。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:52
msgid ""
"**Keep every fact.** Natural is not looser: a condition, a number, a "
"default, an order of steps or a warning in the English stays in the "
"Chinese, with the same strength. Do not add explanations the English does"
" not give."
msgstr "**事实一个都不能少。** 自然不等于随意：英文里的条件、数字、默认值、步骤顺序和警告，中文里都要有，语气也不能减弱。英文没说的解释，也不要自己加。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:56
msgid ""
"**Rebuild long sentences.** English hangs conditions and details off a "
"noun in relative clauses; Chinese states the condition first and then the"
" result, and splits a long sentence into short ones. A string of 的 in "
"front of a noun is the usual sign that a clause should become its own "
"sentence."
msgstr ""
"**长句要拆开重组。** "
"英文习惯用从句把条件和细节挂在名词后面；中文一般先说条件、再说结果，长句拆成几个短句。名词前面堆了一串\"的\"，通常就说明有个从句应该单独成句。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:61
msgid ""
"**Drop the pronouns and filler English needs.** Most *it*, *its* and "
"*they* disappear in Chinese or become the noun they stand for. Leave out "
"进行, 一个 in front of every noun, 能够 and 从而 unless they carry meaning. "
"Prefer the active voice; use 被 only when the passive is the point."
msgstr ""
"**英文离不开的代词和虚词，中文大多可以省掉。** 英文里的 "
"*it*、*its*、*they*，到了中文多半直接省略，或者换回它指代的名词。\"进行\"、每个名词前的\"一个\"、\"能够\"、\"从而\"，没有实际意思就别写。尽量用主动句，只有在被动本身就是重点时才用\"被\"。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:66
msgid ""
"**Translate the meaning, not the word.** *That exact host* is 这台主机, not "
"那台确切的主机; *runs agents against a repository* is 处理仓库; *buys inference* is "
"调用模型. When an English idiom has no direct Chinese equivalent, say plainly"
" what it means."
msgstr ""
"**翻意思，不翻字面。** *That exact host* 就是\"这台主机\"，不是\"那台确切的主机\"；*runs agents "
"against a repository* 是\"处理仓库\"；*buys inference* "
"是\"调用模型\"。英文里的说法在中文里找不到对应时，就直接把意思讲明白。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:71
msgid ""
"**Talk to the reader.** Address the reader as 你 in instructions, and use "
"请 sparingly. Spell out what to do in the order they will do it."
msgstr "**跟读者说话。** 在操作说明里称读者为\"你\"，\"请\"字少用。按读者实际操作的顺序，把要做的事一步步写清楚。"

