#: ../developer/translations.md:80
msgid "Chinese traps"
msgstr "中文里的坑"

#: ../developer/translations.md:82
msgid ""
"The first three are silent: the build stays green and the page is wrong. "
"The structural check in `make docs-verify` catches them."
msgstr "前三个坑都不会报错：构建照样通过，页面却是错的。`make docs-verify` 里的结构检查能把它们揪出来。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:85
msgid ""
"**Keep code, link targets and markup exactly.** Inline code, URLs, link "
"targets, anchors, environment variable names and command lines stay as "
"they are. Translate a link's text, never its target. The check compares "
"the inline code literals and link targets of each translated page with "
"the English one."
msgstr ""
"**代码、链接目标和标记一字不改。** "
"行内代码、URL、链接目标、锚点、环境变量名和命令行都原样保留。链接只翻译显示的文字，目标绝不能动。检查会逐页比对译文和英文的行内代码与链接目标。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:90
msgid ""
"**A heading that starts with a number is dropped.** MyST reads `1. ` as a"
" list marker, the structure no longer matches the source, and Sphinx "
"emits the English heading. Escape the period: `msgstr \"1\\. 申请一个节点\"`."
msgstr ""
"**以数字开头的标题会丢失。** MyST 会把 `1. ` 当成列表标记，结构和原文对不上，Sphinx "
"就退回去显示英文标题。把句点转义即可：`msgstr \"1\\. 申请一个节点\"`。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:94
msgid ""
"**Emphasis next to Chinese punctuation.** A closing `**` preceded by a "
"Chinese full stop and followed by a Chinese character is not recognised, "
"so `**术语。**后文` shows literal asterisks. Put the punctuation outside the "
"bold: `**术语**。后文`. The same applies when bold text starts or ends with "
"code or a quotation mark: ``**`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`**的默认值`` breaks, so add a "
"space, ``**`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`** 的默认值``."
msgstr ""
"**加粗紧挨中文标点。** 如果收尾的 `**` 前面是中文句号、后面紧跟中文字符，它就不会被识别，`**术语。**后文` "
"会直接显示出星号。把标点挪到加粗外面：`**术语**。后文`。加粗文字以代码或引号开头、结尾时也一样，``**`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`**的默认值``"
" 会出错，要加一个空格：``**`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`** 的默认值``。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:101
msgid ""
"**A stale `.mo` masks your edits.** Sphinx skips recompiling when the "
"`.mo` is newer than its `.po`. Before checking a build, run `find "
"docs/developer/locale -name '*.mo' -delete`."
msgstr ""
"**旧的 `.mo` 会让你的修改看不出效果。** 只要 `.mo` 比对应的 `.po` 新，Sphinx "
"就不会重新编译。检查构建结果之前，先运行 `find docs/developer/locale -name '*.mo' -delete`。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:105
msgid "Chinese terminology"
msgstr "中文术语"

#: ../developer/translations.md:107
msgid ""
"Use the same Chinese for a term on every page. Product and component "
"names, UI labels shown in bold, API fields, states and command names stay"
" in English."
msgstr "同一个术语在所有页面都用同一个中文说法。产品名、组件名、以粗体显示的界面文字、API 字段、状态值和命令名保留英文。"

